MODULE: ColdCancellationReleasesIgnoresCancelledHolder
TARGET: ColdCancellationReleases
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: actual lifetime cancellation cannot unwind a hung cold holder
PERTURBS: BudgetOpportunity

--- FIND
          THEN Return(r, "idle")
--- REPLACE
          THEN UNCHANGED <<holders, free, withheld, queue, status, role, observed,
              pressure, pressurePhase, drain, hung, holdLeft, deadline, frontier,
              banked, checkpoint, holes, ledger, arrivalsClosed, dispatchEpoch,
              clientActive, cancelled>>
--- END
